# Data Dictionary

## Purpose

This document defines the fields, formats, standards, and rules used
in the Congolese Football Intelligence project.

The purpose of the data dictionary is to ensure that information is
collected consistently, interpreted consistently, and remains usable
for analysis as the project grows.

---

## Table: players

| Field | Description | Data Type | Format / Allowed Values |
|---|---|---|---|
| player_id | Permanent unique identifier assigned to a player | Text | COD000001, COD000002, etc. |
| first_name | Player's verified first name | Text | Standard text |
| last_name | Player's verified last name | Text | Standard text |
| full_name | Combination of verified first and last names | Text | First name + space + last name |
| date_of_birth | Player's date of birth | Date | YYYY-MM-DD |
| nationality | Player's documented nationality | Text | Standard country name |

